/*
 * The classic "Log On to Windows" dialog - resources
 *
 * The layout is XP's, measured on the XP VM (2026-11-08, docs/SAFE_MODE_WORKORDER.md C4) and converted to dialog units
 * of 8-point Tahoma (6 x 13): a 411 x 210 client area, a 93-pixel banner, edit boxes of 243 x 20 at 84,114 and 84,140,
 * buttons of 75 x 23 on row 176 ending 10 pixels inside the frame. The template follows ReactOS's IDD_LOGON
 * (dll/win32/msgina/lang/en-US.rc, ReactOS Team, GPL-2.0-or-later) and its messages.
